  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the jazz lounge booth, Ikezawa signals Mama-san and sets down a staggering pile of cash in front of Muranishi and Toshi: three hundred million yen. He offers to buy out all of Muranishi's Hokudai Kanda bookstores before they expand past Hokkaido and clash with him—only for Muranishi to bow politely and walk out. Listen to the high-stakes negotiation first without worrying about every detail.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "ママ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "お前さんの店、俺にすべて買い取らせてくれないかな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "三億ある。これは手付金だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "なぜうちを？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "北大神田書店はこの先も拡大するよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "当然、お前さんは販売網を北海道からさらに広げるわな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "そうなるとだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "俺たちは不幸な形で出会ってしまう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "失礼します。あなたに会えてよかった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "行くぞ、トシ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ちょっと待ってよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Even with three hundred million yen on the table, the threat and the refusal stay remarkably composed. Let's break down the key lines.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "お前さんの店、俺にすべて買い取らせてくれないかな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would you let me buy out all of your stores?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "三億ある。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is three hundred million yen here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "これは手付金だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is the deposit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "なぜうちを？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why our company?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "北大神田書店はこの先も拡大するよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hokudai Kanda bookstores will keep expanding from here on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "当然、お前さんは販売網を北海道からさらに広げるわな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Naturally, you will expand your sales network even further beyond Hokkaido, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "俺たちは不幸な形で出会ってしまう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will end up meeting in an unfortunate way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "失礼します。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me for leaving.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あなたに会えてよかった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am glad I got to meet you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "行くぞ、トシ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us go, Toshi.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ちょっと待ってよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, wait up.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
